# GOOGLE AI CORE V3 — FORENSIC HARDENING & VERIFICATION UPGRADE SPECIFICATION

## PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing Google Ai Core V3 forensic auditing system into a structurally reliable, independently verifiable .NET DLL and IL analysis engine.

The objective is to establish trustworthy evidence for the original Ceto / Ocean implementation, including its CPU pipeline, GPU pipeline, displacement processing, wave queries, and related implementation details.

This is a forensic verification task, NOT a report-formatting task.

Do not claim that a method, structure, or technical behavior is VERIFIED merely because a token, method name, or expected text was found.

Every verification claim must be supported by actual parsed data and reproducible validation results.

