Before making any modification:

1. Inspect every file in the existing Google Ai Core V3 directory.
2. Read the current source code, manifests, reports, decoder implementations, and self-audit scripts.
3. Identify the existing DLL input path, output path, command-line arguments, and dependencies.
4. Map the current implementation architecture.
5. Identify reusable components and existing validation logic.
6. Record the original SHA256 hashes of all files that may be modified.
