- Raw IL SHA256.
- Full method body SHA256.
- EH section information.
- Decoder results.
- Validation status.

Do not use method name alone as a unique identifier.

Do not use arbitrary text windows to calculate method hashes.

Hash the exact byte ranges established by the parser.

